{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/fvMTGz2kUZKqlCrpH7WcqA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:56.059103+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/fvMTGz2kUZKqlCrpH7WcqA","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>浙江大学信息与电子工程学院（以下简称信电学院）将于</span><strong><span>2025年7月4-6日举办“2025年全国优秀大学生暑期学术夏令营”活动</span></strong><span><strong><span>（线下）</span></strong></span><span>。本次活动旨在促进全国优秀大学生之间的交流，增进优秀大学生对信电学院相关学科的全面了解，感受浙江大学“信电 ISEE”的风采，同时为基础扎实、热爱科研、德才兼备、立志攻读</span><span><strong><span>博士学位</span></strong></span><span>的优秀学生构建了解深造前景的平台。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>夏令营期间，我院将举办学科专业介绍、导师交流等多项活动，欢迎学业突出、热爱研究、勇于创新的优秀本科生积极参加本次夏令营活动。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>本次夏令营优先选拔预期能取得母校外推免试资格且有强烈意愿就读我院直博生的同学。夏令营报名工作自即日开始，到</span><span><strong><span>6月15日</span></strong><strong><span>结束</span></strong><span>。</span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>专业介绍</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>本次夏令营具体专业、方向介绍如下：</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>1. 信息与通信工程专业（</span><span><strong><span><span><span>拟招收营员数：40人左右</span></span><strong><span><span>）</span></span></strong></span></strong></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><strong><span><strong><span><br/></span></strong></span></strong></span></span></p><p><span><span>主要研究方向：新一代通信与智能网络、抗干扰低截获通信与无线网络安全、视觉感知认知与高效编码、机器视觉与无人自主导航、声信号处理与水域信息网络、先进计算架构与智能系统芯片设计等。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>信息与通信工程专业本年度按三个方向（研究所）招生，分别为：信号空间和信息系统研究所、信息与通信网络工程研究所、智能通信网络与安全研究所。考生报名时应填写研究所意向。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>拟招收营员专业：信息与通信工程、计算机科学与应用、软件工程、电子科学与技术、控制科学与工程、应用数学、水声工程、统计学以及相关专业三年级（2026年毕业）在校本科生； 本校非本学院的学生也欢迎参加！</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>2. 电子科学与技术专业 电子信息工程方向 <span>（</span></span><strong><span><span><span>拟招收营员数：40人左右）</span></span></span></strong></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></span></strong></p><p><span><span>主要研究方向：统计信息与图像处理、射频与光子信息处理、毫米波与智能系统、感知技术与智能系统、先进射频工程、电磁信息与电子集成、智能电子信息系统、阵列信号处理，物联网。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>拟招收营员专业：电子科学与技术、信息与通信工程、控制、计算机、物理、应用数学以及相关专业三年级（2026年毕业）在校本科生； 本校非本学院的学生也欢迎参加！</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>3. 电子科学与技术专业 微电子集成系统方向<span>（</span></span><strong><span><span><span>拟招收营员数：30人左右）</span></span></span></strong></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></span></strong></p><p><span><span>主要研究方向：以系统为牵引，系统带器件，器件带材料，包括集成微纳系统、微纳传感器、硅基光子芯片、柔性可穿戴电子、集成电路芯片、微纳光电子器件、半导体器件工艺等。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>拟招收营员专业：电子科学与技术、微电子、信息、材料、物理、光电、生仪、化学、自动化、计算机以及相关专业三年级（2026年毕业）在校本科生； 本校非本学院的学生也欢迎参加！</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>报名资格</span></b></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>1. </span><strong><span>学业成绩优秀。</span></strong><span>预期可获得母校推荐免试资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>2. </span><strong><span>英语水平良好。</span></strong><span>要求</span><strong><span>国家英语六级水平考试480分及以上</span></strong><span>（460分-480分之间，在其他方面有突出表现的，也可予以考虑）或有较好的</span><strong><span>TOEFL（80及分以上）或雅思（5.5分及以上）成绩</span></strong><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名方式</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>1. </span><strong><span>网上报名</span></strong><span>：自即日起至6月15日进入“2025年浙江大学夏令营系统”报名（具体操作方法请点击文末“阅读原文”）。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>2. </span><strong><span>材料递交</span></strong><span>：</span><strong><span>无需邮寄纸质材料</span></strong><span>，按报名系统要求在网上提交相关材料（上传材料应包含成绩单和排名情况，需加盖院系的成绩校核章，其他希望呈现的材料可一并打包上传）扫描件即可；</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span>3. </span>入选营员的其他材料可在开营前另行提交。</span></span></strong></p></section><section><p><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p><p><span><strong><span><span>特别注意：</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>（1）填报</span><strong><span><span>电子科学与技术专业</span></span></strong><span>的申请人，</span><strong><span>请务必在“攻读方向”栏中明确选择“电子信息工程方向”或“微电子集成系统方向”</span></strong><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>（2）填报</span><span><strong><span>信息与通信工程专业</span></strong></span><span>的申请人，</span><strong><span>请务必在“攻读方向”栏中明确选择信号空间和信息系统研究所、信息与通信网络工程研究所或智能通信网络与安全研究所。</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span><br/></span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>（3）相关导师介绍及所属方向请点击文末“阅读原文”。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>每人只能选择一个方向，便于后续审核和选拔。因未填写攻读方向而未能入选者，后果由申请人自行承担。</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><span> </span></span></p><p><span><span>审核和选拔工作由我院组织相关专业老师负责。营员选拔工作将于</span><strong><span>6月20日左右</span></strong><span>结束，</span><strong><span>入选名单于6月20日左右在申请系统中公布，并通知本人（以电子邮件形式）</span></strong><span>，入选同学需在</span><strong><span>2025年6月23日上午10点前</span></strong><span>确认是否参加，逾期未确认视放弃此资格。</span><strong><span>入选者如有变更，不能参加夏令营，请第一时间告知我们，以把机会让给其他同学。</span></strong><strong><span>6月26日</span></strong><span>后未接到入选通知的同学皆为未入选者，不再另行通知。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>信电学院主页及各学科可参考网址：http://www.isee.zju.edu.cn/</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>大致日程安排</span></span></strong><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>7月4日下午</span></span></strong><span><span>报到，</span><strong><span>7月5-6日</span></strong><span>为主体活动时间。具体日程将在报名结束后发给入选的同学。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>学生食宿及补助</span></span></strong><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>1. 营员的食宿费用由我院承担并统一安排，交通自理。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2. 住宿：</span><strong><span>7月4日―7月6日（中午12时）</span></strong><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3. 保险：我院统一购买在浙大活动期间的团体意外保险，建议各位营员自购旅途意外保险。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>注意事项</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>1. 参加暑期夏令营的学生必须遵守浙江大学的相关规定，按照统一的安排参加各项活动，并注意安全。</span></p><p><span>2. 营员报到后要求全程参加夏令营活动，擅自离营者，将被取消资格，举办方不提供相关资助。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>地址：浙江省杭州市浙大路38号浙江大学玉泉校区行政楼121室</span></span></p><p><span><span>邮件：报名及夏令营活动</span></span></p><p><span><span>咨询：liujing1002@zju.edu.cn，刘老师</span></span></p><p><span><span>电话：0571-87951572</span></span></p><p><span><span>邮编：310027</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><span>导师一览表、研究生管理系统夏令营模块学生操作手册，可点击</span></span><strong><span><span>“阅读原文”</span></span></strong><span><span>下载。</span></span></span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>内容来源：信电学院研究生科</span></span></p><p><span><span>编辑：蔡超 陈瑜欣</span></span></p><p><span><span>审核：戴志潜</span></span></p></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"5e086c45effb89871b31509311ff0979c047046c8edf3de8255b37522abd3469","textLength":2119,"sourceSha256":"c8f796b4ff7c02fb01af83680c37208ed62cf522cac31900282b31d111968d65","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-e0577c262e26411058d0","title":"2025年浙江大学信息与电子工程学院2025年全国优秀大学生暑期学术夏令营活动通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:56.059103+00:00"}
